      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: Do you have some problem where you desperately need the focus on the camera to be flipped horizontally when you turn it around or something? Otherwise, why are you still posting? \nI know there's a button. That button can get blocked by literally anything and it takes longer to align the cursor to the camera window than it does to grab it and flip it around. You should try thinking before you post.",
