      "value": "@{5d21c1a8154b187933d51a3e|full_name}: I posted two times, one asking why even flip it and the second time saying that there is a button for it, so you don't need to turn it around anymore. \nI never said that this shouldn't be fixed. I was just curious why you would turn it around, because I haven't done that since the update was in beta and I didn't really understood why to do that in the first place. After that I just replied to you to let you know that there is a button for it, in case of you not knowing that.\nAnd if you wanna know why I haven't upvoted it yet, that's because I only upvote issues I have experienced it / have tested out to see if it is actually an bug. Since I haven't done that yet I haven't upvoted it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
